nounogram_words — attribution for the word data
=================================================

The word lists in this package (data/, lib/data/)
are derived from the following sources and are released under CC BY-SA 4.0.

- Fry Instant Word List (Edward B. Fry) — public domain.
  Used for Kindergarten–Grade 5 (frequency blocks).

- Dolch Sight Words (Edward W. Dolch) — public domain.
  Used as Pre-K–Grade 3 anchors.

- New General Service List (NGSL), © Charles Browne, Brent Culligan &
  Joseph Phillips — CC BY-SA 4.0. https://www.newgeneralservicelist.com/
  Used for Grades 6–8 (split by frequency rank).

- New Academic Word List (NAWL), © Charles Browne, Brent Culligan &
  Joseph Phillips — CC BY-SA 4.0. https://www.newgeneralservicelist.com/new-academic-word-list-nawl
  Used for Grades 9–12 (split by frequency rank).

- SCOWL (Spell Checker Oriented Word Lists), Copyright 2000-2018 Kevin
  Atkinson, 2020.12.07 — permissive (see tool/data/scowl/COPYRIGHT).
  http://wordlist.aspell.net/ Used for lib/data/lexicon.txt (tiers up to 70) and to split the tiers past
  Grade 12 by how common a word is.

- 12dicts (Alan Beale), 6.0.2 — public domain, acknowledgment requested.
  http://wordlist.aspell.net/12dicts/ The 3esl and 2of12 lists are the
  Familiar, Uncommon and Obscure levels (lib/data/{familiar,uncommon,obscure}.txt).

